    "title": "SimCity BuildIt",
    "description": "Welcome, Mayor to the city builder & simulator! Be the hero of your very own city metropolis as you design & create a beautiful, bustling metropolis. Every decision  is yours as your city simulation gets larger & more intricate. You need to make smart choices as a city builder to keep your citizens happy & your skyline growing. Then trade, chat, compete, & join clubs with fellow Mayors. Build your way & your city to extraordinary!\r\n\r\nBRING YOUR CITY METROPOLIS TO LIFE\r\nBuild your metropolis skyscrapers, parks, bridges, & much more! Place buildings strategically to keep the taxes flowing & your city growing. Solve real-life challenges like traffic & pollution. Provide your city services like power plants & police departments. Keep traffic moving with grand avenues & streetcars in this fun city builder & simulator.\r\n\r\nPUT YOUR IMAGINATION & CITY ON THE MAP\r\nThe possibilities are endless in this city building simulator! Build Tokyo-, London- or Paris-style neighborhoods, & unlock exclusive city landmarks like the Eiffel Tower or Statue of Liberty. Discover new technologies with the Future Cities while getting athletic with sports stadiums & become a pro city builder. Decorate your city with rivers, lakes & forests, & expand along the beach or on the mountain slopes. Unlock new geographic regions for your metropolis such as the Sunny Isles or Frosty Fjords, each with a unique architectural style. There\u2019s always something new & different to make your city simulation unique.\r\n\r\nBATTLE YOUR WAY TO VICTORY\r\nDefend your city metropolis against monsters or compete against other mayors in Club Wars. Plot winning city builder strategies with your Club mates & declare war on other cities. Once the battle simulation is on, unleash crazy disasters like the Disco Twister & Plant Monster on your opponents. Earn valuable rewards to use in battle or to improve your city. In addition, take on other players in the Contest of Mayors, where you can complete weekly challenges & climb the League ranks towards the top. Each new contest Season brings on new unique rewards to beautify your city!\r\n\r\nBUILD A BETTER CITY WITH TRAINS\r\nImprove as a city builder with unlockable & upgradeable trains. Discover new trains & train stations for your dream metropolis! Expand & customize your rail network to fit your unique city simulation.\r\n\r\nCONNECT & TEAM UP\r\nJoin a Mayor\u2019s Club to trade city supplies with other members & chat about strategies & available resources. Collaborate with other city builders to help someone complete their personal vision & get support to complete yours. Build big, work together, lead other Mayors, & watch your city simulation come to life!\r\n\r\n-------\r\nImportant Consumer Information. This app:\r\nRequires a persistent Internet connection (network fees may apply). Requires acceptance of EA\u2019s Privacy & Cookie Policy and User Agreement. Includes in-game advertising. Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. The app uses Google Play Game Services. Log out of Google Play Game Services before installation if you don\u2019t want to share your game play with friends.\r\n\r\nUser Agreement: http://terms.ea.com\r\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy: http://privacy.ea.com\r\nVisit https://help.ea.com/en/ for assistance or inquiries.\r\n\r\nEA may retire online features after 30 days\u2019 notice posted on www.ea.com/service-updates.",
